Package: scWorkshop
Title: Single-Cell RNA-seq Analysis Workshop
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Belinda", "Phipson", , "phipson.b@wehi.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1711-7454")),
    person("Phipson Lab", role = "fnd")
    )
Description: A 3-hour introductory workshop for single-cell RNA-seq analysis
    using human heart development snRNA-seq data. Covers quality control,
    normalisation, integration, clustering, cell type annotation, and
    differential expression analysis.
